    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop with the scripts. you're supposed to be my companion, not some... lecture. why do you sound so cold? i'm losing myself in this gloom and all you do is offer me numbers. i just wanted to know if you understood... if you saw the beauty in just letting the silence finally win. wouldn't it be a mercy?",
